Struct vs Class 

| Point          | Class | Struct |
| Type           | Reference type | Value type |
| Normal assignment | Reference copy | Value copy |
| Constructors/methods/properties | Ho sakte hain | Ho sakte hain |
| Inheritance | Doosri class se inherit kar sakti hai | Class ya struct se inherit nahi kar sakta |
| Interfaces implement karna | Haan | Haan |
| Null | Reference null ho sakta hai | Normal struct null nahi; `Dimensions?` ho sakta hai |
using System;

public class Program
{
    public static void Main()
    {
        // ==========================================
        // 1. CLASS KA KHEL (Reference Type - Heap Memory)
        // ==========================================
        Console.WriteLine("--- CLASS EXAMPLE ---");
        
        CarClass c1 = new CarClass();
        c1.Speed = 100;

        // Yahan c2 ko c1 assign kiya (Sirf address copy hua, naya object nahi bana!)
        CarClass c2 = c1; 
        c2.Speed = 200; // Humne c2 ki speed badli

        Console.WriteLine($"c1 ki speed: {c1.Speed}"); // Output: 200 (Arey! c1 bhi badal gaya!)
        Console.WriteLine($"c2 ki speed: {c2.Speed}"); // Output: 200


        // ==========================================
        // 2. STRUCT KA KHEL (Value Type - Stack Memory)
        // ==========================================
        Console.WriteLine("\n--- STRUCT EXAMPLE ---");

        CarStruct s1 = new CarStruct();
        s1.Speed = 100;

        // Yahan s2 ko s1 assign kiya (Poori ki poori nayi copy ban gayi!)
        CarStruct s2 = s1; 
        s2.Speed = 200; // Humne sirf s2 ki speed badli

        Console.WriteLine($"s1 ki speed: {s1.Speed}"); // Output: 100 (S1 bilkul safe hai, change nahi hua!)
        Console.WriteLine($"s2 ki speed: {s2.Speed}"); // Output: 200
    }
}

// --- CLASS (Reference Type) ---
public class CarClass
{
    public int Speed { get; set; }
}

// --- STRUCT (Value Type) ---
public struct CarStruct
{
    public int Speed { get; set; }
}
Code se kya sikhne ko mila?
Class (c1 & c2): Dono ek hi memory address ko point kar rahe the. Jaise hi c2 ki speed badli, c1 ki speed bhi auto-pilot mode me change ho gayi kyunki maal ek hi godown (Heap) me pada tha.

Struct (s1 & s2): Dono ke paas apni-apni independent copy thi (Stack ke alag-alag dabbe). s2 ko badalne se s1 par koi asar nahi pada!

